Package: immor
Title: Real Estate Portal Aggregator
Version: 0.0.0.9004
Authors@R:
    person("Layal Christine", "Lettry", , "layal@cynkra.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0008-6396-0523"))
Description: Scrapes and aggregates real estate listings from property
    portals. Supports 'flatfox.ch' (REST API) and 'weck-aeby.ch'
    (HTML scraping via CasaWP). Provides a normalized 28-column schema
    for cross-portal comparison and deduplication of listings appearing
    on multiple sites. Designed for use with 'blockr.immor' for
    interactive visual data pipelines.
